&nbsp;
Neil,
&nbsp;
Can we please take out the below? Gramercy LLC refers to the asset management entity as opposed to the investment funds, which are the parties to the funding agreements. My point is that Gramercy is averse
 to including the asset management company.
&nbsp;
The information above is given without prejudice to any position that Gramercy
LLC may wish to take should it be met with an application by your clients.
&nbsp;
I am unsure about the word in red below, but I believe that the explanation is in the following para copied below. Therefore, although the facility is repaid from proceeds that PG recovers as profit costs
 from the cases, the money characterization has become income when PG repays the facility. Do you agree?
&nbsp;
There is also no element of return under either facility relating to a share of damages
or costs recovered by the clients in the proceedings.
&nbsp;
Gramercy 1 and Gramercy 3 have rights to repayment toward any outstanding facility amounts via sweep mechanisms set out in the loan agreements of
all income received by Pogust Goodhead, which obviously includes income that results from cases successfully litigated under CFAs. This is a right to repayment of the facility and does not represent a share of any recovery by the clients in the proceedings.
&nbsp;
Thank you.
