cuments. The defendants' aggregate statement of costs comes to over £500k. The cost of any security for costs application will be substantially higher if done on a similar scale. &nbsp;We attach hereto the following documents for Gramercy’s review and approval:&nbsp;(i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; NBI from Toremis(ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Overarching priority deed regulating the cross-collateralisation. Please note that this draft is based on the existing wrapper deed (subject to the specific terms agreed with Toremis). (iii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Insurance policy terms(iv)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Amendments and Restatement to the Individual Priorities Deeds. The ones for the remaining cases will follow. &nbsp;Please let us know if you have any questions. We appreciate it if you could prioritise this, given the court deadlines mentioned above.&nbsp;Thank you.&nbsp;Kind regards &nbsp;&nbsp;​​​​Carolina&nbsp;Koschdoski&nbsp;de&nbsp;SouzaLegal&nbsp;DirectorFrom: Helena Yearwood &lt;hyearwood@pogustgoodhead.com&gt; Sent: 13 November 2025 14:39To: Carolina Koschdoski de Souza &lt;csouza@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Nick Paolazzi &lt;npaolazzi@gramercy.com&gt;; Tom Crow &lt;tcrow@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Joshua Katz &lt;jkatz@gramercy.com&gt;; Donatas Juskauskas &lt;djuskauskas@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Cc: James Taylor &lt;JTaylor@gramercy.com&gt;; Marc Zelina &lt;mzelina@gramercy.com&gt;; Josh O'Melia &lt;jomelia@gramercy.com&gt;; Alicia Alinia &lt;aalinia@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Joseph Moreno &lt;jmoreno@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Howard Morris &lt;hmorris@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Subject: RE: Enquiry for Additional ATE Cover – Pa