can we make sure the attached Pan-NOx CFAs are signed ASAP.&nbsp;Many thanks,Sarah&nbsp;&nbsp;​​​​Sarah&nbsp;BinghamLegal&nbsp;Director+44&nbsp;(0)&nbsp;7484&nbsp;085&nbsp;187From:&nbsp;Sarah Bingham &lt;sbingham@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Sent:&nbsp;Monday, October 13, 2025 11:39To:&nbsp;Anna Varga &lt;avarga@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Dilan Alma &lt;dalma@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Nishanth Vasanth Kumar &lt;nkumar@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Cc:&nbsp;Jamie Macfarlane &lt;jmacfarlane@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Alicia Alinia &lt;aalinia@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Fiona Huddleston &lt;FHuddleston@leighday.co.uk&gt;; Martyn Day &lt;mday@leighday.co.uk&gt;; Michael Burke &lt;mburke@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Sophia Thomson &lt;sthomson@leighday.co.uk&gt;Subject:&nbsp;Re: Counsel CFAs&nbsp;Hi all,I hope everyone is well&nbsp;and happy first day of trial.I spoke with Sophia this morning, and it appears there was a misunderstanding last week regarding the Counsel CFAs.Sophia spoke with Counsel’s clerks on Friday evening, and it’s only the Pan-NOx CFAs&nbsp;that Counsel would like signed and returned,&nbsp;as we’re still working on the GLO-specific CFAs&nbsp;with George.Attached are 19 Pan-NOx CFAs, signed by Counsel and Leigh Day. These are now ready for Pogust Goodhead&nbsp;to sign, please. @Dilan Alma.We are still waiting on Counsel’s signatures for the Pan-NOx CFAs for Chloë Bell (3VB), Zoe O'Sullivan KC (Serle Court), and Jennifer Meech (Serle Court). We will follow up on&nbsp;these so that LD/PG can then sign.I’ll speak with George this week to progress and finalise the GLO-specific CFAs.Best regards,Sarah&nbsp;​​​​Sarah&nbsp;BinghamLegal&nbsp;Director+44&nbsp;(0)&nbsp;7484&nbsp;085&nbsp;187From:&nbsp;Anna Varga &lt;avarga@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Sent:&nbsp;Friday, October 10, 2025 11:09To:&nbsp;Sophia Thomson &lt;sthomson@leighday.co.uk&gt;; Michael Burke &lt;mburke@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Martyn Day &lt;mday@leighday.co.uk&gt;Cc:&nbsp;Fiona Huddleston &lt;FHuddleston@leighday.co.uk&gt;; Jami